sequenceDiagram
  actor U as User
  participant A as API
  participant G as Gate
  participant E as Equivalence
  participant D as Database
  U->>A: GET item options
  A->>A: Is this the owner's item?
  A->>G: require_verified(item)
  alt not verified
    G-->>A: refuse
    A-->>U: 409 item_not_verified, no prices
  else verified
    G-->>A: medicine id
    A->>D: Products sharing an ingredient
    A->>E: compare(reference, other)
    alt any difference
      E-->>A: differences
      A-->>U: Not directly comparable, with reasons
    else identical
      E-->>A: equivalent
      A-->>U: Option with sourced prices, pack differences and savings within one price type
    end
  end
